#: include/operator.php
msgid "Compare loss and latency with the SmokePing graphs and maintenance state. Escalate missing files, imports and relinking to an administrator."
msgstr "Thelekisa ilahleko kunye nolandelelwano lwexesha lokulibaziseka (latency) neegrafu ze-SmokePing kunye nemo yolondolozo. Dlulisela iifayile ezilahlekileyo, ungeniso kunye nokuqhagamshela kwakhona kumlawuli."

