msgid "YAML (default)"
msgstr "YAML (ehlala ikhethiwe)"

#: lib/ConfigPage.php lib/Pages.php
msgid "SmokePing Configuration"
msgstr "Uqwalaselo lwe-SmokePing"

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
msgid "Your device permissions do not cover every device, so you cannot export or import the SmokePing configuration. Ask an administrator with access to all devices."
msgstr "Iimvume zakho zesixhobo aziquki zonke izixhobo, ngoko awukwazi ukukhuphela okanye ukungenisa uqwalaselo lwe-SmokePing. Cela umlawuli onofikelelo kuzo zonke izixhobo."

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
msgid "Export the SmokePing Configuration"
msgstr "Khuphela Uqwalaselo lwe-SmokePing"

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
msgid "The export holds the plugin settings, the SmokePing targets the plugin has read, and which device each is mapped to, by the device's host name and description. It holds no data source, graph, RRD file, or credential."
msgstr "Ukhuphelo lugcina iisetingi zeplagini, iithagethi ze-SmokePing ezifundwe yiplagini, kunye nesixhobo ngasinye esinxulunyaniswe kuso, ngegama le-host yesixhobo kunye nenkcazo. Alugcini mthombo wedatha, grafu, fayile ye-RRD, okanye ziqinisekiso."

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
msgid "Download"
msgstr "Khuphela"

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
msgid "Import a SmokePing Configuration"
msgstr "Ngenisa Uqwalaselo lwe-SmokePing"

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
msgid "Choosing a file only checks it. The next screen lists every change the file would make, and nothing is written until you confirm that list. An import adds and updates; it never deletes a target or moves a mapping, and it never creates an RRD file or touches the SmokePing data directory."
msgstr "Ukukhetha ifayile kuyayihlola kuphela. Isikrini esilandelayo sidwelisa lonke utshintsho oluya kwenziwa yifayile, kwaye akukho nto ibhalwayo de uqinisekise olo luhlu. Ungeniso luyongeza kwaye luyahlaziya; aluze lucime ithagethi okanye lususe unxulumaniso, kwaye aluze ludale ifayile ye-RRD okanye luchukumise uvimba weefayile wedatha ye-SmokePing."

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
msgid "Check File"
msgstr "Hlola Ifayile"

#: lib/ConfigPage.php lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "Import Check"
msgstr "Uhlolo loNgeniso"

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
msgid "Nothing was written."
msgstr "Akukho nto ibhaliweyo."

#: lib/ConfigPage.php lib/ImportPage.php smokeping_import.php
msgid "Back"
msgstr "Emva"

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
msgid "The file cannot be imported until these errors are fixed. Nothing was written."
msgstr "Ifayile ayinakungeniswa de ezi mpazamo zilungiswe. Akukho nto ibhaliweyo."

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
msgid "The installation already matches the file. There is nothing to import."
msgstr "Ukufakelwa sele kuhambelana nefayile. Akukho nto yokungenisa."

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
#, php-format
msgid "Plan %s. Applying makes exactly these changes in one transaction. If the file or the installation changed since this check, the import is refused and you check again."
msgstr "Isicwangciso %s. Ukusebenzisa kwenza olu tshintsho kanye kwitransaction enye. Ukuba ifayile okanye ukufakelwa kutshintshile ukususela kolu hlolo, ungeniso luyaliwa kwaye uhlola kwakhona."

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
msgid "Apply Import"
msgstr "Sebenzisa Ungeniso"

#: lib/ConfigPage.php lib/ImportPage.php lib/InventoryForms.php
msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "Rhoxisa"

#: lib/DeviceActions.php
msgid "Add SmokePing Targets"
msgstr "Yongeza Iithagethi ze-SmokePing"

#: lib/DeviceActions.php
msgid "no matching SmokePing target"
msgstr "akukho thagethi ye-SmokePing ehambelanayo"

#: lib/DeviceActions.php
msgid "Click Continue to add the SmokePing targets whose host is the host name of each selected device. Each target gets a summary graph for alerting and, when SmokePing's data can be graphed, a smoke graph. Devices are never created here."
msgstr "Cofa u-Qhubeka ukongeza iithagethi ze-SmokePing ezine-host eligama le-host yesixhobo ngasinye esikhethiweyo. Ithagethi nganye ifumana igrafu yesishwankathelo yokulumkisa kwaye, xa idatha ye-SmokePing inokuzotywa kwigrafu, igrafu ye-smoke. Izixhobo azize zidalwe apha."

#: lib/DeviceActions.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d targets match."
msgstr "Iithagethi ezi-%d ziyahambelana."

#: lib/DeviceActions.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d objects created or mapped, %d skipped."
msgstr "Izinto ezi-%d zidalwe okanye zanxulunyaniswa, ezi-%d zitsityiwe."

#: lib/DeviceSaveCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "This device has SmokePing targets, but the reader that fills their summary values runs on poller %d and the device is saved on poller %d. Summary values and alerts stop until the device is assigned to poller %d again."
msgstr "Esi sixhobo sineethagethi ze-SmokePing, kodwa isifundi esizalisa amaxabiso azo esishwankathelo sisebenza kwi-poller %d kwaye isixhobo sigcinwe kwi-poller %d. Amaxabiso esishwankathelo kunye nezilumkiso ziyayeka de isixhobo sabelwe kwi-poller %d kwakhona."

#: lib/GraphLinks.php
msgid "SmokePing Targets of this Device"
msgstr "Iithagethi ze-SmokePing zesi Sixhobo"

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d smoke graphs still draw the other colors; the main poller moves up to 200 per cycle."
msgstr "Iigrafu ze-smoke ezi-%d zisazoba eminye imibala; i-poller engundoqo ihambisa ukuya kuthi ga kwi-200 ngomjikelo."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d smoke graphs could not be moved; run upgrade-graphs to try them again, and see the Cacti log for the cause."
msgstr "Iigrafu ze-smoke ezi-%d azikwazanga ukuhanjiswa; sebenzisa i-upgrade-graphs ukuzizama kwakhona, kwaye ujonge ilogi ye-Cacti ukufumana unobangela."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "The Loss Colors setting asks for SmokePing %s loss colors, but the reader found SmokePing %s. Set it to Automatic unless the graphs should differ from SmokePing's."
msgstr "Isetingi ye-Loss Colors icela imibala yelahleko ye-SmokePing %s, kodwa isifundi sifumene i-SmokePing %s. Yisete ku-Automatic ngaphandle kokuba iigrafu kufuneka zahluke kweze-SmokePing."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "The Loss Colors setting selects SmokePing %s loss colors for smoke graphs."
msgstr "Isetingi ye-Loss Colors ikhetha imibala yelahleko ye-SmokePing %s yeegrafu ze-smoke."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
msgid "The reader found no SmokePing version, so the Loss Colors setting selects the loss colors of SmokePing 2.8 and later. If SmokePing is 2.7, set Loss Colors to SmokePing 2.7."
msgstr "Isifundi asifumananga nguqulelo ye-SmokePing, ngoko isetingi ye-Loss Colors ikhetha imibala yelahleko ye-SmokePing 2.8 nakamva. Ukuba i-SmokePing ngu-2.7, seta i-Loss Colors ibe ngu-SmokePing 2.7."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "The reader found SmokePing %s, so the Loss Colors setting selects its loss colors."
msgstr "Isifundi sifumene i-SmokePing %s, ngoko isetingi ye-Loss Colors ikhetha imibala yayo yelahleko."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
msgid "Thold is not installed, so no target alerts in both SmokePing and Thold."
msgstr "I-Thold ayifakelwanga, ngoko akukho thagethi ilumkisa kuyo yomibini i-SmokePing kunye ne-Thold."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
msgid "No target has both a SmokePing alert and an enabled Thold threshold."
msgstr "Akukho thagethi inesilumkiso se-SmokePing kunye ne-threshold ye-Thold evuliweyo zombini."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d targets have both a SmokePing alert and an enabled Thold threshold, so one problem may notify twice. Compare their alert conditions before removing either: %s"
msgstr "Iithagethi ezi-%d zinesilumkiso se-SmokePing kunye ne-threshold ye-Thold evuliweyo zombini, ngoko ingxaki enye inokwazisa kabini. Thelekisa iimeko zazo zesilumkiso phambi kokuba ususe enye yazo: %s"

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "The SmokePing templates failed to import and are not retried automatically: %s Use Retry Template Import after fixing the cause."
msgstr "Iitempleyithi ze-SmokePing zisilele ukungeniswa kwaye azizanywa kwakhona ngokuzenzekelayo: %s Sebenzisa u-Zama Kwakhona Ungeniso Lwetempleyithi emva kokulungisa unobangela."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
msgid "The SmokePing templates are not imported. Use Retry Template Import."
msgstr "Iitempleyithi ze-SmokePing azingeniswanga. Sebenzisa u-Zama Kwakhona Ungeniso Lwetempleyithi."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php smokeping_health.php
msgid "The SmokePing templates are imported."
msgstr "Iitempleyithi ze-SmokePing zingenisiwe."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
msgid "Every device with summary data sources is polled by the reader's poller."
msgstr "Sonke isixhobo esinemithombo yedatha yesishwankathelo sifumanwa yi-poller yesifundi."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d devices have summary data sources but are not polled by poller %d, which runs the reader, so their summary values and alerts have no data: %s"
msgstr "Izixhobo ezi-%d zinemithombo yedatha yesishwankathelo kodwa azifumanwa yi-poller %d, eqhuba isifundi, ngoko amaxabiso azo esishwankathelo kunye nezilumkiso azinadatha: %s"

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "The SmokePing configuration is read on poller %d, not on this server; the inventory row shows the result of its last read."
msgstr "Uqwalaselo lwe-SmokePing lufundwa kwi-poller %d, hayi kule seva; umqolo we-inventory ubonisa isiphumo sokufunda kwayo kokugqibela."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "The SmokePing configuration %s cannot be read: %s"
msgstr "Uqwalaselo lwe-SmokePing %s alukwazi kufundwa: %s"

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "The SmokePing configuration %s lists %d targets; %d entries are skipped: %s"
msgstr "Uqwalaselo lwe-SmokePing %s ludwelisa iithagethi ezi-%d; amangeniso ama-%d atsityiwe: %s"

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "The SmokePing configuration %s lists %d targets."
msgstr "Uqwalaselo lwe-SmokePing %s ludwelisa iithagethi ezi-%d."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
msgid "The PHP binary path setting is empty or not an executable file, so the reader cannot start."
msgstr "Isetingi yendlela yefayile ephunyezwayo ye-PHP ayinanto okanye ayisiyofayile ephunyezwayo, ngoko isifundi asinakuqalisa."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "The reader starts with %s."
msgstr "Isifundi siqalisa nge-%s."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
msgid "The reader has not completed a run on this poller."
msgstr "Isifundi asikagqibi ukusebenza kule poller."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "The last reader run finished %d seconds ago, more than three poller intervals."
msgstr "Ukusebenza kokugqibela kwesifundi kugqitywe kwimizuzwana eyi-%d edlulileyo, ngaphezulu kwamathuba amathathu e-poller."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "The reader read %d of %d series in %.1f seconds and has exceeded its time budget %d times."
msgstr "Isifundi sifunde uthotho oluyi-%d kweziyi-%d kwimizuzwana eyi-%.1f kwaye sidlule umda waso wexesha izihlandlo ezi-%d."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "The reader read %d of %d series in %.1f seconds, %d seconds ago."
msgstr "Isifundi sifunde uthotho oluyi-%d kweziyi-%d kwimizuzwana eyi-%.1f, kwimizuzwana eyi-%d edlulileyo."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
msgid "No inventory has been read on this poller."
msgstr "Akukho inventory ifundiweyo kule poller."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "The last inventory failed %d seconds ago and the previous one is still in use: %s"
msgstr "I-inventory yokugqibela isilele kwimizuzwana eyi-%d edlulileyo kwaye eyangaphambili isasetyenziswa: %s"

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "The inventory listed %d targets %d seconds ago."
msgstr "I-inventory idwelise iithagethi ezi-%d kwimizuzwana eyi-%d edlulileyo."

