msgstr "Ngenisa Uqwalaselo lwe-SmokePing"

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "Configuration"
msgstr "Uqwalaselo"

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "The configured SmokePing file is read with the files it includes, from its own directory. An uploaded file is read on its own: @include is not allowed in it."
msgstr "Ifayile ye-SmokePing eqwalaselweyo ifundwa kunye neefayile eziqukayo, ukusuka kuvimba wayo weefayile. Ifayile elayishiweyo ifundwa yodwa: i-@include ayivumelekanga kuyo."

#: lib/ImportPage.php
#, php-format
msgid "The configured file, %s"
msgstr "Ifayile eqwalaselweyo, %s"

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "An uploaded file, without @include"
msgstr "Ifayile elayishiweyo, ngaphandle kwe-@include"

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "Uploaded File"
msgstr "Ifayile Elayishiweyo"

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "Only for an uploaded file: a SmokePing configuration of at most 4 MiB."
msgstr "Yefayile elayishiweyo kuphela: uqwalaselo lwe-SmokePing olungadluli kwi-4 MiB."

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "Devices"
msgstr "Izixhobo"

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "One device per SmokePing host groups targets that probe the same host. A device that already has the host name on the chosen poller is used instead of a new one."
msgstr "Isixhobo esinye nge-host ye-SmokePing sidibanisa iithagethi ezihlola i-host efanayo. Isixhobo esesinalo igama le-host kwi-poller ekhethiweyo sisetyenziswa endaweni yesitsha."

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "One device per SmokePing host"
msgstr "Isixhobo esinye nge-host ye-SmokePing"

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "One device per SmokePing target"
msgstr "Isixhobo esinye ngethagethi ye-SmokePing"

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "Device Template"
msgstr "Itempleyithi Yesixhobo"

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "The template of devices the import creates."
msgstr "Itempleyithi yezixhobo ezidalwa lungeniso."

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "Poller"
msgstr "Poller"

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "The poller of new devices. It must be the poller that runs the SmokePing reader, or their summary data sources get no data."
msgstr "I-poller yezixhobo ezitsha. Kufuneka ibe yi-poller eqhuba isifundi se-SmokePing, okanye imithombo yazo yedatha yesishwankathelo ayifumani datha."

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "Site"
msgstr "Isayithi"

#: lib/ImportPage.php
