msgstr "Isayithi yezixhobo ezitsha."

#: lib/ImportPage.php smokeping_inventory.php
msgid "None"
msgstr "Akukho"

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "Graph Tree"
msgstr "Umthi Weegrafu"

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "Mirror the SmokePing hierarchy into a graph tree: each section becomes a branch, and each device a host under the branch of its targets. Existing branches and hosts are reused."
msgstr "Bonisa ulwakhiwo lwe-SmokePing kumthi weegrafu: icandelo ngalinye liba lisebe, kwaye isixhobo ngasinye siba yi-host phantsi kwesebe leethagethi zaso. Amasebe nee-host esele zikhona ziyasetyenziswa kwakhona."

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "A new tree, named below"
msgstr "Umthi omtsha, othiywe ngezantsi"

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "Do not mirror"
msgstr "Musa ukufanisa"

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "New Tree Name"
msgstr "Igama Lomthi Omtsha"

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "Only for a new tree. A tree that already has this name is used."
msgstr "Yomthi omtsha kuphela. Umthi osenalo eli gama uyasetyenziswa."

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "Preview reads the configuration and lists what the import would create. Nothing is written until you confirm that list on the next screen, and SmokePing's own files are never written."
msgstr "Imboniso yangaphambili ifunda uqwalaselo kwaye idwelise oko ungeniso oluya kukudala. Akukho nto ibhalwayo de uqinisekise olo luhlu kwisikrini esilandelayo, kwaye iifayile ze-SmokePing ngokwazo azize zibhalwe."

