msgstr "Yinxulumanise nesixhobo esele sikhona"

#: lib/InventoryForms.php
msgid "Either way the target gets a summary graph for alerting and, when SmokePing's data can be graphed, a smoke graph. Cacti never writes SmokePing's files."
msgstr "Ngayo nayiphi na indlela ithagethi ifumana igrafu yesishwankathelo yokulumkisa kwaye, xa idatha ye-SmokePing inokuzotywa kwigrafu, igrafu ye-smoke. I-Cacti ayize ibhale iifayile ze-SmokePing."

