#: lib/InventoryForms.php
msgid "Re-linking moves the smoke graph and the summary data source to the new target and the device mapping with them. The old file keeps its history in an archived graph. Nothing is deleted."
msgstr "Ukuqhagamshela kwakhona kuhambisa igrafu ye-smoke kunye nomthombo wedatha yesishwankathelo kwithagethi entsha kunye nonxulumaniso lwesixhobo kunye nazo. Ifayile endala igcina imbali yayo kwigrafu egciniweyo. Akukho nto icinywayo."

