#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "SmokePing Source"
msgstr "Umthombo weSmokePing"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "SmokePing Poller"
msgstr "Ipoler yeSmokePing"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "The Cacti poller that runs on, or shares a filesystem with, the SmokePing host. Only this poller reads SmokePing data."
msgstr "Ipoler yeCacti esebenza kumsingathi weSmokePing, okanye eyabelana nawo ngenkqubo yeefayile. Le poler yodwa efunda idatha yeSmokePing."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "SmokePing Configuration File"
msgstr "Ifayile yoQwalaselo lweSmokePing"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "The main SmokePing configuration file, read by the poller that runs the reader. The plugin reads it and the files it includes with its own parser and never writes to them. Includes must stay inside this file's directory."
msgstr "Ifayile engundoqo yoqwalaselo lweSmokePing, efundwa yipoler eqhuba umfundi. Iplagin iyayifunda kunye neefayile eziqukwa yiyo ngesahluli sayo kwaye ayize ibhale kuzo. Izinto eziqukiweyo kufuneka zihlale ngaphakathi kwidirekthori yale fayile."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "SmokePing Data Directory"
msgstr "Idirekthori yeDatha yeSmokePing"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "The datadir from SmokePing's configuration, as SmokePing sees it."
msgstr "I-datadir evela kuqwalaselo lweSmokePing, njengoko iSmokePing iyibona."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Cacti Mount of the Data Directory"
msgstr "Imount yeCacti yeDirekthori yeDatha"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "A read-only bind or NFS mount of the SmokePing data directory inside the Cacti RRA path. Cacti only reads RRD files inside its RRA path and never through a symlink."
msgstr "Imount ye-bind okanye ye-NFS efundwa kuphela yedirekthori yedatha yeSmokePing ngaphakathi kwendlela ye-RRA yeCacti. ICacti ifunda iifayile ze-RRD kuphela ngaphakathi kwendlela yayo ye-RRA kwaye ayize ifunde nge-symlink."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Reader"
msgstr "Isifundi"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Reader Time Budget"
msgstr "Uhlahlo Lwexesha Lwesifundi"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds one reader run may spend reading RRD files before it stops and resumes on the next poller cycle."
msgstr "Imizuzwana umsebenzi omnye womfundi onokuyichitha efunda iifayile ze-RRD phambi kokuba ume kwaye uqhubeke kumjikelo olandelayo wepoler."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Inventory Interval"
msgstr "Isithuba soLuhlu"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Minimum seconds between inventory runs. The inventory also runs when the configuration file changes."
msgstr "Ubuncinci bemizuzwana phakathi kokusebenza koluhlu. Uluhlu lukwasebenza xa ifayile yoqwalaselo itshintsha."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Freshness Allowance"
msgstr "Isibonelelo soButsha"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds past one step for which a measurement still counts as current."
msgstr "Imizuzwana emva kwenyathelo elinye apho umlinganiselo usabalwa njengowangoku."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Loss Colors"
msgstr "Imibala yeLahleko"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Which SmokePing loss colors the smoke graphs draw. SmokePing 2.7 draws other loss levels than 2.8 and later. Automatic follows the SmokePing version the reader finds next to SmokePing, shown on the health page, and uses 2.8 and later when it finds none."
msgstr "Yeyiphi imibala yelahleko yeSmokePing ezotywa ziigrafu ze-smoke. ISmokePing 2.7 izoba amanqanaba elahleko ahlukileyo kuno-2.8 nangaphezulu. Okuzenzekelayo kulandela uhlelo lweSmokePing olufunyenwe ngumfundi ecaleni kweSmokePing, oluboniswe kwiphepha lempilo, kwaye kusebenzisa u-2.8 nangaphezulu xa kungafumananga nto."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Automatic"
msgstr "Okuzenzekelayo"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "SmokePing 2.8 and later"
msgstr "ISmokePing 2.8 nangaphezulu"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "SmokePing 2.7"
msgstr "ISmokePing 2.7"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Uninstall"
msgstr "Khupha"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Keep Plugin Tables on Uninstall"
msgstr "Gcina iiTheyibhile ze-Plugin xa uKhupha"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "When checked, uninstalling the plugin keeps its inventory, mapping, and health tables. SmokePing files are never removed either way."
msgstr "Xa kukhethiwe, ukususa iplagin kugcina iitheyibhile zayo zoluhlu, zonxulumaniso, kunye nezempilo. Iifayile zeSmokePing azize zisuswe nangayiphi na indlela."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Backup Directory"
msgstr "Idirekthori yoGcino"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Where the uninstall writes its export of the plugin configuration. Leave blank to use the cache/smokeping directory of Cacti, which the plugin protects with a deny-all rule. A directory set here must already exist, be writable, and be outside the web root; when it is not writable no export is written."
msgstr "Apho ukususwa kubhala khona uthumelo ngaphandle loqwalaselo lweplagin. Shiya kungenanto ukuze usebenzise idirekthori ye-cache/smokeping yeCacti, ekhuselwe yiplagin ngomgaqo wokwala konke. Idirekthori emiselwe apha kufuneka ibe sele ikhona, ikwazi ukubhalwa, kwaye ibe ngaphandle kwengcambu yewebhu; xa ingakwazi ukubhalwa akukho thumelo ngaphandle olubhalwayo."

